# Secrets and identity — never commit.
#
# Every real value (ACI, both phone numbers, the API key) lives ONLY in
# ~/.config/hongyan/config.json, outside this tree. The rules below are the
# first line; scripts/scan-identity.py is the second, and it runs as a
# pre-commit hook and again over every tracked file in the test suite, so
# nobody has to read a diff to catch a leak.
config.json
config.json.*
*.key
nous.key

# Runtime state, logs and captured conversation.
*.log
*.log.1
audit.log*
daemon.log*
listener.log*
watchdog.log*
history.json
queue.jsonl
seen.json
heartbeat
socket
*.pid
down_since
restart_fails
monthly-reply-*.txt

# Backups and scratch.
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.tmp
__pycache__/
*.pyc
